  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/piggyback_title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<div><a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faewulf/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFaeWulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\" height=\"56\"> </a></div>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" height=\"40\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"PayPal\" height=\"40\"> </a></div>\n<hr>\n<h2>📑 簡介</h2>\n<p><strong>Piggyback Rides</strong> 是一款有趣且輕量的小模組，將 Minecraft 預設的坐下機制改為更自然的騎乘式搭肩玩法。你不再坐在其他玩家的頭上，而是騎在他們的背上，非常適合合作冒險、搞笑角色扮演或混亂的場景！</p>\n<h2>📦 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>空手右鍵點擊蹲下的玩家，即可跳到其背上。</li>\n<li>將原本的坐下姿勢替換為搭肩騎乘姿勢。</li>\n<li>完全支援多人遊戲。</li>\n<li>支援玩家疊疊樂（沒錯，你可以堆出人形神像！）。</li>\n<li>騎乘者無法轉身回頭張望，類似於騎船時的視角限制。</li>\n<li>可選設定：載人時會減緩被載者的移動速度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🎥 展示</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>騎乘教學：<img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/howToUse.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"使用教學\"></li>\n<li>玩家疊疊樂 <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/example2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"範例 1\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/example1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"範例 2\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⚙️ 設定</h2>\n<p>本模組可透過以下方式進行設定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>設定檔位於 config/piggyback.toml</li>\n<li>遊戲內的設定選單</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⚠️ 所需模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fabric API</li>\n<li>Faewulfs Lib</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔗 相容性</h2>\n<p>Piggyback 設計為與其他模組相容。若您遇到任何問題，請至該模組的問題追蹤頁面回報。</p>\n<h2>💖 支援</h2>\n<p>如需技術支援、功能建議或錯誤回報，請前往模組的 GitHub Issues 頁面，或加入我的 Discord 伺服器：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a></p>\n<h2>📜 授權條款</h2>\n<p>只要給予適當的署名，您便可在整合包中使用此模組。</p>",
